<td style="padding-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;"><img src="https://vs.example.test/icons/icon-192.png" width="28" height="28" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;border-radius:6px;"></td>
<td style="vertical-align:middle;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#ffffff;">VisaStack</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e9f1;border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 16px 16px;padding:32px 28px 28px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d4c98;">Your Case</p>
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#13243d;">A closed case is due to be cleared</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#13243d;">The one fact this notice carries.</p>

<div style="height:12px;"></div>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td style="border-radius:980px;background:#1d4c98;">
