</td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#516174;">Your profile and documents stay; only the closed case records go.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#596879;">If the button does not open, copy this address into your browser:<br><a href="https://vs.example.test" style="color:#1d4c98;word-break:break-all;">https://vs.example.test</a></p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 28px 0;">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#596879;">VisaStack keeps one visa record you reuse for every application. You decide what is shared, with whom and for how long.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#596879;">This email was sent to person@example.test.</p>

</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
