<p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#516174;">Accepted by your agency&#39;s reviewer for your file. It is not a decision on your visa.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#596879;">If the button does not open, copy this address into your browser:<br><a href="https://vs.example.test" style="color:#1d4c98;word-break:break-all;">https://vs.example.test</a></p>
</td></tr>
